---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant API as CLI / library operation
    participant Control as Control DB
    participant Coordinator
    participant Execution as Execution DBs
    participant Worker
    Operator->>API: Cancel run
    API->>Control: Commit revoked revision + pending destinations
    API->>Execution: Attempt bounded revision-fenced delivery
    Execution-->>API: Applied; live leases may remain
    API-->>Operator: Current outcome; terminal may be false
    loop Outstanding delivery only
        Coordinator->>Control: Claim bounded pending destinations
        Coordinator->>Execution: Bind claimed identity; apply control revision
        Worker->>Execution: Existing heartbeat observes control
        Worker->>Worker: Stop new cases; cancel supported calls
        Worker->>Execution: Persist safe results; release chunk lease
        Execution-->>Coordinator: Applied / quiescent observations
        Coordinator->>Control: Scope acknowledgement; match claimed revision and token
    end
    Coordinator->>Control: Claim quiescent revocation and retain work identity
    Coordinator->>Execution: Scope cleanup; settle unfinished work and receipts
    Coordinator->>Control: Scope final summary and event; acknowledge matching revision/token
    Note over Coordinator,Execution: A partition delays settlement; application is not a global stop.
